## 9. Semantic pass — state machine

Read as: checking → applying → activating/reserving/configuring/installing → verifying →
complete | failed, with parallel billing states (not activated / already active / activated
not undone / unconfirmed) and reservation states (saved / existing / unconfirmed).
No state moved sides. Negation presence identical on all 76 keys. Details in `report.md`
and `record.safety_adjacent_verdict`.

